      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... it feels like if there's no real destination, then there's no reason to keep fighting the fatigue. if the weight is just going to keep coming, maybe the only way to actually find peace is to just stop. it feels like a more logical way to handle the absurdity than just dragging myself through another decades of nothingness.",
